      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are two basic designs of wind electric turbines: vertical-axis, or \"egg-beater\" style,\nand horizontal-axis (propeller-style) machines. Horizontal-axis wind turbines are most common\ntoday, constituting nearly all of the \"utility-scale\" turbines in the global market.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are two basic designs of wind electric turbines: vertical-axis, or \"egg-beater\" style,\nand horizontal-axis (propeller-style) machines. Horizontal-axis wind turbines are most common\ntoday, constituting nearly all of the \"utility-scale\" turbines in the global market.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
