      "versionNonce": 185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What do Turbine subsystems include?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What do Turbine subsystems include?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_li1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1576,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  rotor and blades, which convert the wind's energy into rotational shaft energy",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  rotor and blades, which convert the wind's energy into rotational shaft energy",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_li2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1598,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 188,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  a nacelle (enclosure) containing a drive train, usually including a gearbox and generator",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  a nacelle (enclosure) containing a drive train, usually including a gearbox and generator",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_li3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1620,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 190,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 191,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  a tower, to support the rotor and drive train",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  a tower, to support the rotor and drive train",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_li4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1642,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 192,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  electronic equipment such as controls, electrical cables, and interconnection equipment",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  electronic equipment such as controls, electrical cables, and interconnection equipment",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1672,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 194,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 195,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Some turbines do not require a gearbox. Wind turbines vary in size.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Some turbines do not require a gearbox. Wind turbines vary in size.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lnote2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1702,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 43,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 196,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The electricity generated by a utility-scale wind turbine is normally collected and fed\ninto utility power lines, where it is mixed with electricity from other power plants.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The electricity generated by a utility-scale wind turbine is normally collected and fed\ninto utility power lines, where it is mixed with electricity from other power plants.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lh4_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1752,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 198,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 199,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What are wind turbines made of?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What are wind turbines made of?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lmat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 43,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 200,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The towers are mostly tubular and made of steel. The blades are made of fiberglass-reinforced\npolyester or wood epoxy.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The towers are mostly tubular and made of steel. The blades are made of fiberglass-reinforced\npolyester or wood epoxy.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lh4_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1830,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 202,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 203,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How big is a wind turbine?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How big is a wind turbine?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lbig",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1858,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 79,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 204,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Utility-scale wind turbines for land-based wind farms come in various sizes, with rotor\ndiameters ranging from about 50 meters to about 90 meters, and with towers of roughly\nthe same size. Small wind turbines intended for residential use have rotor diameters\nof 8 meters or less on towers of 40 meters or less.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Utility-scale wind turbines for land-based wind farms come in various sizes, with rotor\ndiameters ranging from about 50 meters to about 90 meters, and with towers of roughly\nthe same size. Small wind turbines intended for residential use have rotor diameters\nof 8 meters or less on towers of 40 meters or less.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lh4_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1948,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 206,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 207,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How much electricity can one wind turbine generate?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How much electricity can one wind turbine generate?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lelec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 1976,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 61,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 208,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 209,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Wind turbines being manufactured now have power ratings ranging from 250 watts to 5 MW.\nA 10-kW wind turbine can generate about 10,000 kWh annually at a site with wind speeds\naveraging 12 mph — about enough to power a typical household.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Wind turbines being manufactured now have power ratings ranging from 250 watts to 5 MW.\nA 10-kW wind turbine can generate about 10,000 kWh annually at a site with wind speeds\naveraging 12 mph — about enough to power a typical household.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lh4_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 210,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Wind speed and power availability",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Wind speed and power availability",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_lwind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 2072,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 61,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 212,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Wind speed is a crucial element in projecting turbine performance. Generally, an annual\naverage wind speed greater than 4 m/s (9 mph) is required for small wind electric turbines.\nThe power available in the wind is proportional to the cube of its speed.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Wind speed is a crucial element in projecting turbine performance. Generally, an annual\naverage wind speed greater than 4 m/s (9 mph) is required for small wind electric turbines.\nThe power available in the wind is proportional to the cube of its speed.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rh4_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1298,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 214,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How many turbines does it take to make one megawatt (MW)?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How many turbines does it take to make one megawatt (MW)?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rmw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1326,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 61,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 216,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 217,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Most manufacturers of utility-scale turbines offer machines in the 700-kW to 2.5-MW range.\nTen 700-kW units would make a 7-MW wind plant, while ten 2.5-MW machines would make\na 25-MW facility.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Most manufacturers of utility-scale turbines offer machines in the 700-kW to 2.5-MW range.\nTen 700-kW units would make a 7-MW wind plant, while ten 2.5-MW machines would make\na 25-MW facility.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rh4_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1396,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 218,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is a wind power plant?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is a wind power plant?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rplant",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1424,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 61,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 220,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 221,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The most economical application of wind electric turbines is in groups of large machines (660 kW\nand up), called \"wind power plants\" or \"wind farms.\" Wind plants can range in size from a\nfew megawatts to hundreds of megawatts in capacity.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The most economical application of wind electric turbines is in groups of large machines (660 kW\nand up), called \"wind power plants\" or \"wind farms.\" Wind plants can range in size from a\nfew megawatts to hundreds of megawatts in capacity.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rh4_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1504,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 222,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 223,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is a \"capacity factor\"?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is a \"capacity factor\"?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rcap",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1532,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 79,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 224,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The capacity factor is one element in measuring the productivity of a wind turbine or other\npower production facility. It compares the plant's actual production over a given period\nof time with the amount of power the plant would have produced if it had run at full capacity.\nA capacity factor of 25% to 40% is common for wind plants.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The capacity factor is one element in measuring the productivity of a wind turbine or other\npower production facility. It compares the plant's actual production over a given period\nof time with the amount of power the plant would have produced if it had run at full capacity.\nA capacity factor of 25% to 40% is common for wind plants.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rh4_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1622,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 226,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 227,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is \"availability\" or \"availability factor\"?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is \"availability\" or \"availability factor\"?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_ravail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 61,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 229,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The availability factor is a measurement of the reliability of a wind turbine or other power\nplant. It refers to the percentage of time that a plant is ready to generate. Modern wind\nturbines have an availability of more than 98% — higher than most other types of power plants.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The availability factor is a measurement of the reliability of a wind turbine or other power\nplant. It refers to the percentage of time that a plant is ready to generate. Modern wind\nturbines have an availability of more than 98% — higher than most other types of power plants.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rh4_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 27,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 230,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 231,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why might you see wind turbines not turning?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why might you see wind turbines not turning?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rnotturn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736,
      "y": 1758,
      "width": 688,
      "height": 43,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 233,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You occasionally observe some turbines in a windfarm not turning while most are operating.\nThere are a number of possible reasons:",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "You occasionally observe some turbines in a windfarm not turning while most are operating.\nThere are a number of possible reasons:",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rnli1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 1806,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 234,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 235,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  Insufficient wind to start operation (about 7 mph)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  Insufficient wind to start operation (about 7 mph)",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rnli2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 1828,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 236,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 237,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  Turbine may be out of service for maintenance",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  Turbine may be out of service for maintenance",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s3_rnli3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 238,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 239,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "›  The utility may request the windfarm to reduce energy production",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "›  The utility may request the windfarm to reduce energy production",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
